#. module: qing_service_client
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:qing_service_client.view_qing_service_instance_form
msgid "QingERP sends basic installation statistics in the background: organization name, system URL, installed module counts, product version and a random instance identifier. Confirm and Register separately sends the tax ID and contact email to request online services. Online services require operator approval and an active subscription. The ERP remains usable without online service registration."
msgstr "QingERP 会在后台上报基本安装统计信息：公司名称、系统网址、已安装模块数量、产品版本和随机实例标识。点击“确认并注册”后，才会另行提交税号和联系邮箱以申请在线服务。在线服务需要运营方审核和有效订阅；未注册在线服务仍可使用 ERP。"
